00:23:14.306 --> 00:23:18.006
that beautiful building.

00:23:16.206 --> 00:23:20.406
If you would have seen that building two

00:23:18.006 --> 00:23:22.506
years ago, it wasn't looking so good.

00:23:20.406 --> 00:23:24.006
But through a lot of talent within all

00:23:22.506 --> 00:23:24.906
within the

00:23:24.006 --> 00:23:26.006
uh

00:23:24.906 --> 00:23:28.606
I guess you could say the great

00:23:26.006 --> 00:23:30.706
professionals here, the Department of

00:23:28.606 --> 00:23:33.306
Interior. Thank you very much Greg and

00:23:30.706 --> 00:23:35.406
everybody and Doug, Doug Burgum.

00:23:33.306 --> 00:23:36.906
Uh but we worked very hard on bringing

00:23:35.406 --> 00:23:38.506
the White House back

00:23:36.906 --> 00:23:40.206
and it's now more beautiful in better

