this. But I'm sitting there looking at

00:23:51.306 --> 00:23:55.806
how gorgeous that building is. And

00:23:52.906 --> 00:23:57.606
remember, the White House is maybe the

00:23:55.806 --> 00:23:59.806
number one just about the number one

00:23:57.606 --> 00:24:01.306
symbol of our country. And now when you

